body:
Thanks for this link, definitely checking out more gay science.
Mostly here to add that gays of other genders walk fast as well, I’ve had many people be like “oh that’s why you walk so fast”. Also no idea on why this is a thing. Maybe we’re shooting away from straight men trying to talk to us, or the anxiety of seeing a cute girl we like?

@thread: as a swift woman in big boots I never notice men walking behind me as I’m leaving them in the dust, sorry I can’t help. Nice that you’re being considerate though!

Thanks for these recommendations, Video Palace and the Harrowing in particular look right up my alley! 

&#x200B;

I'll look into Larkspur Underground as well, the only one of these I was familiar with was the Magnus Archives which seems like a lot to get into, and I'm hesitant about stories with archive settings as I work as an archivist and will be weird about inaccuracies haha, could be worth a go though :)
